.bad
This file has a BIN format checksum error, caused by two single bit
error frames (missing the 040 bit).  It will fail to detect stuck low
IR1 and IR2.
.description
8A CPU test diagnostic (bad copy)
.name
Images/diag-games-kermit.0/8acpu.bn
.notes
8acpu.bn is the 8A CPU test diagnostic.  It is essentially a copy of 
maindec-08-djkka-c-pb, with a checksum error and minor differences,
which in fact do explain the checksum error.  These errors have the net
effect that the diagnostic will fail to detect when IR1 and IR2 are stuck
low on the bus.
.partnumber
maindec-08-djkka-c-pb
